{
  "title": "The Copying Light",
  "title_scene": "window",
  "hook_type": "rule",
  "cards": [
    {
      "text": "Never answer a light that copies yours.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572583949319-3d1ea748e486?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "R9ICFNHjsvM",
      "photo_credit": "Garrick Sangil"
    },
    {
      "text": "I keep a lighthouse alone, and no boat comes out this far.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522303225746-3037391fba31?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "fUlDLRuXt9U",
      "photo_credit": "Casey Horner"
    },
    {
      "text": "Last night, out in the black water, something started copying my beam.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594289765464-d4d8b4dcf42d?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "0vOoWtDiKXY",
      "photo_credit": "Clément M."
    },
    {
      "text": "Sweep for sweep, it matched me, and every hour it came closer.",
      "scene": "hallway",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1694449045464-c51369aee068?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "a5btJCloATo",
      "photo_credit": "Haran Amorim"
    },
    {
      "text": "By 3am, it was just off the rocks, and there was no boat under it.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1754922012182-429b9ec37083?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "5Ty3mVwX0Os",
      "photo_credit": "Thomas Marquize"
    },
    {
      "text": "I panicked and flashed back three times, like a warning.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537249011554-eb008faf38c2?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "_4XcZQ-2G5Q",
      "photo_credit": "Casey Horner"
    },
    {
      "text": "Out on the water, its light went dark.",
      "scene": "dark",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613830226160-bac0f2470885?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "42_l9l5Pxwk",
      "photo_credit": "Polina Silivanova"
    },
    {
      "text": "Three slow knocks came from the tower door.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542071519-28ef898f785d?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "hlbA8ZR1ftU",
      "photo_credit": "Edan Cohen"
    }
  ],
